      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am stressing out about this so much, because my name was grandfathered in when they removed the ability to add symbols to your name and seeing as names are so important in this game, it really bothers me how my name went from being a simple name to being\n []Name[]   which I've had for a long time. \nReally hoping they'll let us keep it the way it was.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
