      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Going to link this also: \nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/remove-unique-requirement-on-display-names \nClearing old names is a temporary solution to a problem that doesn't need to exist in the first place. It does nothing when other people are using the same name and are \"active\" users, and disincentivizes people from returning to the game. Giving people another roll for their name is not the point. There should be no \"chance\" to being called what you want.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5fbdd3e50a9e93109d7f261c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5b2821f1443b6a55287c67ad",
        "alias": "Atomic tangerine Chickadee",
        "aliasID": "65c2a219ed6eefce4c62c7cb",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/2e436da535c102847f0e29feac4e5d80.png",
        "created": "2018-06-18T21:19:45.116Z",
        "name": "Aev",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "5b0746088fa72313783e3269",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2020-11-25T03:47:49.170Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5fb73b2eb269064f3dd9c953",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": "5fbdd3e50a9e93109d7f261a",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "We've replaced the box with a small centered circle in the latest build, which will still communicate an \"empty\" character but not be invisible or look as weird as the box. Generally, invisible non-space characters in names are not something that we want to allow.\nWe haven't allowed name changes to abnormal unicode for a long while, so anyone who still has these kinds of symbols in their name should already have a name change available on the website if they'd like to use something else. If not, contact VRChat Support and they'll be happy to help you out.\nWe are investigating alternate solutions for these naming issues, but do not have any further information to offer at this time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
