      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b2821f1443b6a55287c67ad|full_name}: Hi, I'm afraid I don't regard this as complete - the regression here is that the ability to use invisible characters to allow someone to use a name that is otherwise being squatted on has been removed from VRChat. \nIf Canny has the feature it'd be better to flag this as Won't Fix or Closed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
